    {
      "id": "A1-16-L2",
      "position": 2,
      "skill": "grammar",
      "title": "قاعدة: Do you like ...? Yes, I do. / No, I don't.",
      "est_minutes": 15,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "Do you like grapes? Yes, I do. Do you like lemons? No, I don't. Do they like mango? Yes, they do. Do we like dates? Yes, we do."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "لنسأل «هل تحب...؟» نضع **Do** في **أول** الجملة:\n\n- You like grapes. → **Do** you like grapes? (هل تحب العنب؟)\n\nونجيب إجابة قصيرة:\n- **Yes, I do.** (نعم أحب)\n- **No, I don't.** (لا، لا أحب)\n\nمع they و we: **Do they** like mango? **Yes, they do.** **Do we** like dates? **Yes, we do.**\n\n**الخطأ الشائع:** أن نجيب «Yes, I like» أو «Yes, I am». الجواب القصير يرد بـ **do**: **Yes, I do.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "السؤال",
            "نعم",
            "لا"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Do you like apples?",
              "Yes, I do.",
              "No, I don't."
            ],
            [
              "Do they like mango?",
              "Yes, they do.",
              "No, they don't."
            ],
            [
              "Do we like dates?",
              "Yes, we do.",
              "No, we don't."
            ]
          ]
        },
